<header class="rm-head"><div><h1>Usage and add more</h1><p>Your AI credits and sent-email allowance, in one place.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/pricing">Upgrade your plan</a></header><div class="usage-pack-grid"><% for(const meter of summary.meters.filter(m=>['ai_work_credits','emails_sent'].includes(m.meter))){ %><section class="card card-body" data-usage-category="<%= meter.meter %>"><h2><%= meter.meter==='ai_work_credits'?'AI credits':'Emails sent' %></h2><p><strong><%= meter.remaining===null?'Unlimited':Number(meter.remaining||0).toLocaleString() %></strong> remaining</p><p><%= Number(meter.includedUsed||0).toLocaleString() %> of <%= Number(meter.included||0).toLocaleString() %> included used<%= meter.reserved?' · '+Number(meter.reserved).toLocaleString()+' in progress':'' %></p><% if(Number(meter.included)>0&&Number(meter.includedUsed)>=Number(meter.included)*.8){ %><p class="notice notice--warn" role="status"><%= Number(meter.remaining)<=0?'You have used the available allowance. Add a pack or upgrade to continue.':'You have used at least 80% of your included allowance.' %></p><% } %><% for(const pack of packs.filter(p=>p.category===meter.meter)){ %><form method="post" action="/billing/buy-more"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="purchaseKey" value="<%= purchaseKey+':'+pack.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="packId" value="<%= pack.id %>"><button class="btn" data-usage-pack="<%= pack.id %>" <%= checkoutOpen&&pack.purchasable?'':'disabled' %>>Add <%= Number(pack.units).toLocaleString() %> <%= meter.meter==='ai_work_credits'?'AI credits':'emails' %> · <%= new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US',{style:'currency',currency:pack.currency}).format(Number(pack.amount_minor)/100) %></button></form><% } %><% if(!checkoutOpen){ %><p>Pack purchases are unavailable on this installation. Your current allowance and saved work are preserved.</p><% } %></section><% } %></div><p>Purchases are charged only after you confirm in secure checkout. A pack becomes available after payment is verified. Automatic top-up remains off unless you enable it.</p><a class="btn" href="/settings/billing">Billing history and automatic top-up settings</a>
